#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:2
msgid "Azure Blob Storage Backend"
msgstr "Azure Blob 存储后端"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:4
msgid ""
"LMCache can offload KV cache to Azure Blob Storage via an async-native "
"connector (parity with the S3 backend, no NIXL dependency). The connector"
" is selected by an ``azure://`` ``remote_url``."
msgstr "LMCache 可以通过异步原生连接器将 KV Cache 卸载到 Azure Blob Storage（与 S3 后端相同，无 NIXL 依赖）。连接器由 ``azure://`` ``remote_url`` 选择。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:9
msgid "Optional Packages"
msgstr "可选包"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:11
msgid ""
"The Azure SDKs are optional dependencies and are imported lazily, so "
"install them only when you use this backend:"
msgstr "Azure SDK 是可选依赖项，并且是按需导入的，因此仅在使用此后端时安装它们："

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:21
msgid "URL Format"
msgstr "URL 格式"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:27
msgid ""
"The container name is the only value carried in the URL. The storage "
"account and credentials are supplied via ``extra_config``."
msgstr "容器名称是 URL 中唯一携带的值。存储帐户和凭据通过 ``extra_config`` 提供。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:31
msgid "Example Configuration"
msgstr "示例配置"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:46
msgid "Configuration Parameters (in extra_config)"
msgstr "配置参数（在 extra_config 中）"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:48
msgid ""
"**azure_account_url**: Storage account URL, e.g. "
"``https://<account>.blob.core.windows.net``. Required unless "
"``azure_connection_string`` is provided."
msgstr "**azure_account_url**: 存储帐户 URL，例如 ``https://<account>.blob.core.windows.net``。除非提供 ``azure_connection_string``，否则为必填项。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:51
msgid ""
"**azure_connection_string**: Full Azure Storage connection string. When "
"set, it is used on its own and the other fields are ignored."
msgstr "**azure_connection_string**: 完整的 Azure 存储连接字符串。当设置时，它单独使用，其他字段将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:53
msgid ""
"**azure_account_key**: Storage account shared key (paired with "
"``azure_account_url``)."
msgstr "**azure_account_key**: 存储账户共享密钥（与 ``azure_account_url`` 配对）。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:55
msgid ""
"**azure_sas_token**: Shared Access Signature token (paired with "
"``azure_account_url``)."
msgstr "**azure_sas_token**: 共享访问签名令牌（与 ``azure_account_url`` 配对）。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:59
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:61
msgid "Exactly one credential path is resolved, most-explicit-first:"
msgstr "恰好解析出一个凭证路径，优先考虑最明确的："

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:63
msgid "**azure_connection_string** — if set, it wins."
msgstr "**azure_connection_string** — 如果设置了，它将优先。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:64
msgid "**azure_account_url + azure_account_key** — shared-key auth."
msgstr "**azure_account_url + azure_account_key** — 共享密钥认证。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:65
msgid "**azure_account_url + azure_sas_token** — SAS-token auth."
msgstr "**azure_account_url + azure_sas_token** — SAS 令牌认证。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:66
msgid ""
"**azure_account_url** only — falls back to ``DefaultAzureCredential`` "
"(managed identity, environment variables, Azure CLI login, etc.), which "
"requires the ``azure-identity`` package."
msgstr "**azure_account_url** 仅 — 回退到 ``DefaultAzureCredential``（托管身份、环境变量、Azure CLI 登录等），这需要 ``azure-identity`` 包。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:70
msgid ""
"``azure_account_url`` is required for every path except the connection-"
"string case."
msgstr "``azure_account_url`` 在每个路径中都是必需的，除了连接字符串的情况。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:74
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:76
msgid "Only full chunks are stored; set ``save_unfull_chunk: False``."
msgstr "仅存储完整块；设置 ``save_unfull_chunk: False``。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/azure.rst:77
msgid ""
"Keys are flattened into one blob per chunk (same flat layout as the S3 "
"backend)."
msgstr "键被扁平化为每个块一个 blob（与 S3 后端相同的扁平布局）。"

